@startuml
title Oximite Coordinator State Machine

[*] --> Idle : Boot up (wake_up)

Idle --> Sleeping : Timeout (20m) / TogglePower
Sleeping --> Idle : Wake up (Power/Brew/Steam/Flush) \n (Command is dropped to prevent cold start)

note left of Sleeping
  SaveSettings intent does not wake
  the machine and saves silently.
end note

Idle --> Brewing : Brew / RunProfile
Brewing --> Idle : Finish Naturally / Stop (Any Button)

Idle --> Pumping : Flush / DirectPump
Pumping --> Idle : Stop (Any Button)

Idle --> Steaming : Steam
Steaming --> Cooling : Flush (Cooldown flush)
Steaming --> Idle : Steam (Toggle off) / Stop (Any Button)
Cooling --> Idle : Finish Naturally (Temp cooled) / Stop (Any Button)

Idle --> Descaling : Descale
Descaling --> Idle : Finish Naturally / Stop (Any Button)

state Brewing {
  state "Execute Steps" as Steps
  [*] --> Steps
  Steps : MACHINE_STATE = 1
}

state Steaming {
  [*] --> MaintainPressure
  MaintainPressure : MACHINE_STATE = 2
}

state Descaling {
  [*] --> HeatTo60
  HeatTo60 --> PumpHalf : Temp >= 55
  PumpHalf --> Soak : Volume >= 500
  Soak --> PumpEmpty : Timeout (10m)
  PumpEmpty --> [*] : Flow < 0.5
  Descaling : MACHINE_STATE = 3
}

Idle : MACHINE_STATE = 0
Sleeping : MACHINE_STATE = 4
Pumping : MACHINE_STATE = 5
Cooling : MACHINE_STATE = 6

note right of Idle
  Heating up is handled implicitly in Idle.
  Target temperature is maintained continuously.
end note

@enduml
